# Responsive Carousels & View Animations

The user wants to optimize the mobile experience by reducing vertical scrolling (converting stacks to carousels) and ensuring animations only play when visible.

## Proposed Changes
### [Services Sections]
#### [MODIFY] [CoreAdvisory.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/services/CoreAdvisory.tsx)
-   **Old Layout**: Grid (1 column on mobile).
-   **New Layout**: Horizontal Scroll Container on Mobile (`overflow-x-auto`, `snap-x`).
    -   Add padding to ensure cards aren't cut off awkwardly.
    -   Keep grid for tablets/desktop.

#### [MODIFY] [ValuedAudits.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/services/ValuedAudits.tsx)
-   Similar treatment: Convert the grid to a flex container with overflow scrolling on small screens.

#### [MODIFY] [DetailedServices.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/services/DetailedServices.tsx)
-   This is more complex. I will wrap the list in a horizontal scrolling container for mobile.
-   Consider using a "Snap" effect to make it feel like a real carousel.

### [Homepage Hero]
#### [MODIFY] [Hero.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/sections/Hero.tsx)
-   **Current State**: AnimatedCounter runs immediately on load (`useEffect`).
-   **Upgrade**: Implement `IntersectionObserver`.
    -   Refactor [AnimatedCounter](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/sections/Hero.tsx#5-42) to wait until `entry.isIntersecting` is true before starting the `requestAnimationFrame` loop.
    -   Once played, it should not reset (unless desired, but usually play-once is standard for counters).

## Verification
-   **Mobile**: Check each section (Advisory, Audits, Detailed) for horizontal scrolling.
-   **Desktop**: Ensure grids remain intact.
-   **Counters**: Scroll down to them; ensure they start at 0 and count up only when they enter the viewport.
